{% if product.handle == 'glazing-milk' %}
<p>Rhode Glazing Milk adds a lightweight, milky hydration step between cleansing and the rest of your routine. It leaves skin looking dewy and helps prepare it for skincare and makeup.</p>
<h2>What to expect</h2>
<ul><li>Lightweight hydration with a glowy finish.</li><li>Ceramides to support the skin barrier.</li><li>A fragrance-free formula with glycerin, vitamin E and a mineral complex.</li></ul>
<h2>How to use</h2>
<ol><li>Shake before use.</li><li>After cleansing, pour into your hands and gently press onto face and neck.</li><li>Follow with the rest of your skincare routine.</li></ol>
<details lang="ar" dir="rtl"><summary>طريقة الاستخدام</summary><p>رُجّي العبوة، وحطّي شوية في إيدك واربتي على بشرة نضيفة. كمّلي بعده باقي روتين العناية بالبشرة.</p></details>
